      </p>

      <pre is:raw class="bg-slate-950 p-4 rounded-lg border border-slate-800 text-xs font-mono text-emerald-300 overflow-x-auto"><code># Enterprise Zero-Knowledge Content Security Policy (HTTP Response Header)
Content-Security-Policy: default-src 'none'; script-src 'self' 'wasm-unsafe-eval'; style-src 'self'; worker-src 'self' blob:; connect-src 'none'; img-src 'self' blob: data:; frame-ancestors 'none';
</code></pre>

      <p>
